# RDirStat — local development overrides.
#
# Copy to `.env`. Only read when the app is run from a checkout: a bundled
# `.app` is launched with a working directory of `/` and never sees this file,
# so anything set here must also be settable from the storage panel.
#
# Real environment variables win over this file.

# Where completed scans are cached as *.rdstat snapshots.
#
# Overrides the folder chosen in the app's storage panel, for this run only —
# the saved setting is kept and shown, not overwritten. Leave blank or comment
# out to fall back to the panel's setting, and then to
# ~/Library/Application Support/<bundle id>/snapshots.
#
# The store is a cache: it is pruned to two snapshots per scanned root, and a
# full-volume scan of this machine costs roughly a gigabyte. Point it at a
# volume that can afford that.
RDIRSTAT_DATA_DIR=/Volumes/tuf8tb/RDirStat/snapshots
